  "document": "Don't Kill It\nDon't Kill It is a 2016 comedy horror film directed and edited by Mike Mendez. It stars Dolph Lundgren as Jebediah Woodley, a demon hunter who travels to Mississippi in the hopes of destroying an ancient, but homicidal demon. Kristina Klebe, Tony Bentley, James Chalke, and Miles Doleac all star in supporting roles."
